An official/directory connector should follow strong security and privacy practices.

The MCP server should:

Use HTTPS
Validate authentication
Apply least privilege
Validate user input
Avoid leaking secrets
Avoid exposing internal stack traces
Protect upstream credentials
Minimize data returned to Claude
Avoid unnecessary collection of conversation data

Tool results should contain only the information needed to fulfill the requested operation.

