     +-- Transport Layer
     |      |
     |      +-- HTTP / network errors
     |
     +-- Authentication Layer
     |      |
     |      +-- OAuth errors
     |
     +-- MCP / JSON-RPC Layer
     |      |
     |      +-- protocol errors
     |
     +-- Tool Layer
            |
            +-- ValidationFailedError
