48. Final Recommended Design Principle

For a production Claude MCP connector:

Correct MCP semantics
        +
Actionable error handling
        +
Minimal tool orchestration
        +
Small targeted responses
        +
Filtering / pagination
        +
Strong authentication
        +
Safe internal logging
        +
Least-privilege data access
        =
Claude-friendly enterprise MCP architecture

The MCP server should act as an intelligent and controlled interface to the underlying API, rather than simply exposing the API’s largest raw responses directly to the LLM.